Z||000004||fiero56||11-20-1999||06:55 PM||||Sorry about that, looks like I only read the first half of your post.<BR>There were two different color decklid stickers: "silver" and "black. But, there were also two different color "FORMULA" stickers:"silver metallic" and "medium gray metallic".  For bright yellow paint, the "black" decklid sticker was used along with the "medium gray metallic" "FORMULA" sticker.<BR>Hope this isn't too confusing and that it helps.  I love yellow Fieros.<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 11-20-1999).]||||reg||14
